The sentence is "the sky is blue".
The parts is split sentence by " ".
The words is an empty list of text.
For each part in parts.
If the length of part is more than 0, Place part into words.

The last is the last position of words.
The result is empty text.
For every step from 0 to last.
The source is last minus step.
If the length of result is more than 0, Place " " into result.
Place item source of words into result.

Show result.
